  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a ttukbaegi-earthenware-cook over medium heat.",
    "add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent.",
    "add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add the diced red bell pepper and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "add the saffron threads, smoked paprika, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add the chicken broth, white wine, and tomato paste. stir to combine.",
    "add the rice and stir to coat the rice with the oil and mix with the other ingredients.",
    "add the newly harvested festege catalan butter beans and stir to combine.",
    "cook for 20 minutes or until the rice is cooked and the liquid has been absorbed.",
    "remove from heat and let rest for 5 minutes.",
    "serve hot and enjoy!"
